  "buildCSS": "Tailwind4.1.18 generated only from original component classes + minimal offline neutral design tokens, focus/reduced/responsive additions.",
  "originalsLocalOnly": true,
  "changes": [
    "Original scene retained, NextImage replaced ordinary local img.",
    "Original FileUploader uses original react-dropzone; accepted files forwarded into serialized signature-validation queue, rather than stale captured value merging.",
    "Memoized one object URL per File; removal/image decode failure/hidden/failure/exit revoke. FileReaders abort on unmount; epoch/live guard after asynchronous completion.",
    "Strict JPEG/PNG MIME and magic prefix + size/count constraints; image decode failures visibly rejected. Not a full file security scanner.",
    "Local inline rejection message replaces Sonner toast dependency.",
    "Keyboard capture only recognized keys; actual Space spelling; Tab not trapped.",
    "Dropzone focus-cancel timer is scoped and cleared on repeated focus/unmount.",
    "Host early module catch, render boundary and global listener/selectionchange cleanup; hidden resets selection/message."
  ]
